# The Road Forks, the Mimeo Jewel's timer (mission.cop.the_road_forks#jewel). A level 75 Warrior of Windurst with 3-3
# current, the Windurst status 8 and the Lioumere's status 1 (GMs): Attohwa Chasm, Loose Sand at its feet: the Mimeo
# Jewel, the 30 minute timer: the Jewel and 7340 (MIMEO_JEWEL_OFFSET - 1) at once; the timer re-arms every 3 s, but the
# harness's GetSystemTime does not move with tick, so there is no later message and the Jewel is kept.
lists AttohwaChasm/Loose_Sand/onTrigger
char zone=AttohwaChasm pos=478.8,20,41.7 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=2
mission Cop TheRoadForks current
login
tick 1000
tick 1000
tick 1000
missionstatus Cop 8 pos=1               # a GM
charvar Mission[6][325]Status 1         # a GM
trigger Loose_Sand here                 # the Jewel; the timer
finish-if-event
tick 3000
tick 361000
tick 361000
tick 361000
tick 361000
tick 361000
tick 10000
